     "Attach with amended sub-limit",
     "Attach with premium loading",
     "Do not attach"
    ]
   },
   "questions": [
    {
     "id": "qs.bpk.liability.products_supplied",
     "text": "Does the business sell or supply products, and does it manufacture or import any of them?",
